    "role": "assistant",
    "content": "I understand how frustrating it must be to experience flight delays, especially when it happens more than once. I'm sorry for the inconvenience caused.\n\nRegarding your reservation (SDZQKO), I can confirm that all the flights in your round-trip journey from Los Angeles (LAX) to Miami (MIA) and back are currently available and have not been flown yet. The status of each flight is \"available,\" which means they are not yet departed and can be booked or modified if needed.\n\nIf you'd like to proceed with booking a new flight or if you need assistance with your current reservation, please let me know. I'm here to help!",
